  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae Saulo iri kumiít eeharuusér Aako ngiwa dae tlaaqi, nee adór ngir tsu/i gari leelehhiít. Iri daqáy dír kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barwadaá i huwi baraá gixsár Damasko, awa taa gooín amór maraá saaliingw, giri firín, as múk loohír Mungú gaa eehar oo aa sláy nguwa tsegiiti, nee nguwa huwi baraá Yerusalemu, ta hhawaate laqaá /ameena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iwa aa'aá kay, iwa nakaá/ Damasko, naxes gwa/aateemaá gawaá dooraá dahhá' nguri adaá i gwa/aatiyé' bihhe sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iri yaamií huú', afo gari axaás ar inós gwa beer, «Saúlo, Saúlo, ahaá waáy, án mis slahh'eemís?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iri oó', «Kuúng a heemá, Aáko?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heedaádá' iri oó', «Aníng an Yésuudá' kuúng ta slahh'eemis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng na sihhiít, baraá gixsa i daheek, nee adór kuúng wa hariim tleehhamooro kingi kuúng i oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee mukdá' nee Saulo ti alkoomá' tana sihhtanoórí xosl'omiít, asma afo ka axamiis, ala hee ku ga/ayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo niwa yaamuú wa tláy, iwa qaytsiít, naxés ilaawós i xumiisiaaká. Mukdá' nee inós ti alkoomá' guri dawa óh, guri huúw ay Damasko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri iwiwiít deelo tám, i xumaamisiiká, slám i /ayayinká laqaá i wahahanká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala baraá Damaskowo eeharusmoko i deer, umuuwós a Anania. Aako iri oó' dír Anania ar baraá iigu'utu, «Ananía.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anania iri oó', «Aníng a diirí, Aáko.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aako guri báy, «Sihhiít, tláw ay dír loohidá' ta bay Loohír aa gana'. Heé ta bay Saulo, oo yaamaá Tarso, na yaahaaseek dír doó Yudá wa ale. Inós haandá' hamí i firiirín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós heé umuuwós ta bay Anania gwa ár ar baraá iigu'utu, iwa baraadií darahi as nguwa dabií qaasi, ilaawós iwa malé xumsór i ki/iya'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Anania iri oó', «Aáko, kángw heesíng aníng ugwa axmamiís dír múk yaariire, adór heewí muruú tlákw ngura tlehhahhiít dír mukók oo hhohhó' oo baraá Yerusalemuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám ayaawihe hara'aya ga kón ar amór kaahamusér uren ar Mungú daahh, ar mukdá' sleémeero umuuwók ateetimá' nguwa tsegiiti.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Aako iri oó', «Kuúng tláw, asma heesíng a xooslmoó aníng naa tsawaár as umuueé' nguwa alki/iiti dír xoorduuwo nee dír waawitá nee dír múk Israeliwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng adór slahha'amaayér yaariir ir inós wa hariín sleemuuwo as aníng a dirósí laqaám.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anania iri tláy, iri baraá do'dí dáh. Saulo guri dabií qaás, iri oó', «Hhiyaaeé' Saúlo, Aako Yesu, kudá' taa dirógí geehhooees baraá loohidá' nira hardati aníng iga ya/aáw, as ilaawók niwa male qaytsitiya', nee tuwa hatsisi Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Munguhe.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamtidár kilae muruú adór qafo ina baraá ilaawós wa paáhh, iri qaytsiít, iri sihhiít, kuri baatiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá iwa /ayín, /uuru guri sláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iri Damaskór wa hoót deelór hhaawaakahe dinkwa nee eeharuuseedár amoodá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kángw Yesu guri alki/iít baraá maraá saaliingo iwa kaahi, «Inós a Garmoó Mungú.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee múk kaangwí gwa axaas sleémeero tari waa/oo/amín tari káh, «Heewí a kudá' mukduú Mungú oo umuuwí gu ateetiím gwa slahh'emiísiíke baraá Yerusalemuro. Nee gár nisa diirí hardáh aqo kaangwí, ngiwa tsegiiti nee ngiwa huwi amór kaahamuusér uren ar Mungú.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
